    "manaCost": "{3}{G}",
    "typeLine": "Sorcery",
    "oracleText": "Tempting offer — Search your library for a land card and put it onto the battlefield. Each opponent may search their library for a land card and put it onto the battlefield. For each opponent who searches a library this way, search your library for a land card and put it onto the battlefield. Then each player who searched a library this way shuffles.",
    "script": {
